"granularity=fine,compact,1,0\"\nexport MPICH_GNI_FORK_MODE=FULLCOPY\nexport OMP_NUM_THREADS=$threads_per_rank\n\n# 'aprun' is replaced by 'flux run'. 'flux run' will automatically launch the total\n# number of tasks specified by '#FLUX: -n'.\n# Note: Slicing the script's arguments ('${@:4}') is preserved, but the user\n# must now pass only the python script's arguments, not the node/rank counts.\nflux run python profile_train.py ${@:1}\n",
